{"2707440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Floralis", "steam_appid": 2707440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floralis is a narrative-driven puzzle platformer set in a world where plants have evolved into predators. You play as one of two sisters grown from the same tree. When your twin disappears, you must cross the living jungle to find her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will hide from predators, explore ruins, reactivate mysterious objects, and discover small, personal moments of joy. As you piece together what happened to the old world, you will come to realize the truth of your birth — and your place in the new ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE SENTIENT JUNGLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a fragile new lifeform, and everything wants to eat you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnivorous plants use bioluminescence to bait their prey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide, sneak or run for your life if you don’t want to become fertilizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles across 4-5 hours of story offer multiple solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with environment to discover alternative solutions and secret areas</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flora to your advantage — plants can grow and react to light and your actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE A MOMENT TO PLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jungle is filled with forgotten machines, and many of them still work</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with objects to open new routes, unlock secrets and trigger hidden cutscenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those curious machines don’t always serve a purpose but they’re worth discovering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GARDEN OF THE END</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone, but its traces remain buried in roots and moss</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to clues in the background to piece together the backstory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue brings you closer to understanding who you are and the strange reason why you were born</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/4b4a4aa5d8fcf1508fb6268d112684d4.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/4b4a4aa5d8fcf1508fb6268d112684d4.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/4b4a4aa5d8fcf1508fb6268d112684d4.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floralis is a narrative-driven puzzle platformer set in a world where plants have evolved into predators. You play as one of two sisters grown from the same tree. When your twin disappears, you must cross the living jungle to find her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will hide from predators, explore ruins, reactivate mysterious objects, and discover small, personal moments of joy. As you piece together what happened to the old world, you will come to realize the truth of your birth — and your place in the new ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE SENTIENT JUNGLE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a fragile new lifeform, and everything wants to eat you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnivorous plants use bioluminescence to bait their prey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide, sneak or run for your life if you don’t want to become fertilizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/1df07f7ca8eac9a5a19b50c75bbbe2df.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR OWN PATH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many puzzles across 4-5 hours of story offer multiple solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with environment to discover alternative solutions and secret areas</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flora to your advantage — plants can grow and react to light and your actions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/a27cf54c0cbcefefe3e49059052a89e0.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE A MOMENT TO PLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jungle is filled with forgotten machines, and many of them still work</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with objects to open new routes, unlock secrets and trigger hidden cutscenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those curious machines don’t always serve a purpose but they’re worth discovering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.poster.avif?t=1787048475\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.webm?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/extras/12fe0b289b1c889f485baf44fb7a3285.mp4?t=1787048475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE GARDEN OF THE END</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone, but its traces remain buried in roots and moss</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to clues in the background to piece together the backstory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue brings you closer to understanding who you are and the strange reason why you were born</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707440/e